Again, this is a quick demo
of our product on the left

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:35.591
there, with all that scrolling.

00:05:35.591 --> 00:05:38.950
You see our dashboard
and our web portal

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:41.960
where you can manage settings
and things like that, also

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:43.060
view video.

00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:46.120
The middle portion-- that
is our thick client that

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:50.320
is used by 24-7
operations, that you

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:54.560
can see actual, real-time
AI events come in through.

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:57.910
And then on the
furthest right side--

00:05:57.910 --> 00:06:02.890
my right-- that is our iOS
or Android app where you

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:06.820
could actually view live video.

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:08.790
So with that, I'm going
to pass it over to Ben

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:11.289
and he'll talk to you guys about
architecture and high-level

00:06:11.289 --> 00:06:12.030
how we do this.

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:12.655
BEN ROWE: Cool.

00:06:12.655 --> 00:06:13.570
Thank you.

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:14.070
Cool.

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:14.730
Hey, guys.

