I don't know whether you
guys are familiar with it.

00:06:46.875 --> 00:06:49.710
But GKE and we also happen to
have Kubernetes at the edge

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:51.000
as well.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:52.300
Very interesting.

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.300
And then, finally,
